OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer in tears as she admits
OL,4,Aerrors in fatal crash inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer broke down in tears as
OL,7,Fshe admitted errors in her assessment
OL,8,Fof the risk of one of three young women
OL,9,Freported missing who was involved in a
OL,10,Ffatal crash.
OL,12,FPC Lauren Livingstone is one of two
OL,13,Fofficers facing gross misconduct
OL,14,Fallegations over her actions before a
OL,15,Fcar carrying five people was found
OL,16,Fcrashed in St Mellons, Cardiff, on 6
OL,17,FMarch 2023.
OL,19,FEve Smith, Rafel Jeanne, and Darcy Ross
OL,20,Fall died in the crash. Sophie Russon
OL,21,Fand Shane Loughlin survived.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
