OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer in tears as she admits
OL,4,Aerrors in fatal crash inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe three women were reported missing
OL,7,Fto Gwent Police on 4 March, and
OL,8,FLivingstone said she could not remember
OL,9,Fwhether searches had been carried out
OL,10,Fat the homes of Sophie Russon or Eve
OL,11,FSmith, maintaining her account since
OL,12,FMarch 2024.
